  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Description of the bug:\nThe microphone icon is not fixed in place and drifts from its original location if the player view moves. I think this is bad as it draws attention to the icon when it shouldn't, especially when in VR where it elicits the \"there is a fly in the corner of my eye\" response.\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\nUsing a controller while in VR to rotate counterclockwise while observing the microphone icon. This can also be reproduced on dekstop by simply moving the view with the mouse.",
